# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins provider versions
# and their checksums, so committing it is what makes `terraform init` reproducible
# across machines and CI. Ignoring it is a common mistake and silently allows a
# provider upgrade to change behaviour between two runs of the same config.

